  "content": "Event model: create/update/delete events all carry an optional vectors map keyed by embedder ID (e.g. \"voyage:voyage-code-3\"). The standalone \"embedding\" event type was removed - a vector-only update event via memlog.NewVectorEvent handles \"share my model's vector for an existing memory\". Reconcile is two-pass: scan all events to build per-UUID target state with vectors matched to content snapshots via filename ordering, then apply to local DB reusing logged vectors when the embedder ID matches. Events are the source of truth; the SQLite DB is a projection.",
